   },
   "language": "hi-IN",
   "mentions": []
  },
  {
   "id": "utt:mtg:knadh/listmonk:listmonk-handover-campaign-manager-and-config-20261020#0003",
   "meeting_id": "mtg:knadh/listmonk:listmonk-handover-campaign-manager-and-config-20261020",
   "seq": 3,
   "text": "हमने app.concurrency को 10 पे रखा है क्योंकि SES का rate limit hit हो रहा था। जब ये 25 था तो Amazon SES से 454 throttling errors आते थे और campaign बीच में अटक जाती थी।",
   "text_en": null,
   "start_ms": 28000,
   "end_ms": 41000,
   "speaker_label": "S1",
   "speaker": {
    "id": "person:email:rohan.mehta@example.com",
    "name": "Rohan Mehta"
   },
   "language": "hi-IN",
   "mentions": [
    {
     "id": "cfg:knadh/listmonk:schema.sql::app.concurrency",
     "label": "ConfigKey",
     "name": "app.concurrency"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "utt:mtg:knadh/listmonk:listmonk-handover-campaign-manager-and-config-20261020#0004",
   "meeting_id": "mtg:knadh/listmonk:listmonk-handover-campaign-manager-and-config-20261020",
   "seq": 4,
   "text": "मतलब concurrency का मतलब parallel workers है, per campaign?",
   "text_en": null,
   "start_ms": 42000,
   "end_ms": 47000,
   "speaker_label": "S2",
   "speaker": {
    "id": "person:email:priya.nair@example.com",
    "name": "Priya Nair"
   },
   "language": "hi-IN",
   "mentions": []
  },
  {
   "id": "utt:mtg:knadh/listmonk:listmonk-handover-campaign-manager-and-config-20261020#0005",
   "meeting_id": "mtg:knadh/listmonk:listmonk-handover-campaign-manager-and-config-20261020",
   "seq": 5,
   "text": "हाँ, internal/manager में उतने ही goroutines messages push करते हैं। और message_rate को भी 10 रखा है, मतलब हर worker एक second में 10 messages से ज़्यादा push नहीं करेगा। दोनों मिलाकर 100 messages per second, SES की limit उससे ऊपर है इसलिए safe है।",
   "text_en": null,
   "start_ms": 48000,
   "end_ms": 62000,
   "speaker_label": "S1",
   "speaker": {
    "id": "person:email:rohan.mehta@example.com",
    "name": "Rohan Mehta"
   },
   "language": "hi-IN",
   "mentions": [
    {
     "id": "cfg:knadh/listmonk:schema.sql::app.message_rate",
     "label": "ConfigKey",
     "name": "app.message_rate"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "utt:mtg:knadh/listmonk:listmonk-handover-campaign-manager-and-config-20261020#0006",
   "meeting_id": "mtg:knadh/listmonk:listmonk-handover-campaign-manager-and-config-20261020",
   "seq": 6,
   "text": "ये numbers कहाँ documented हैं? मुझे याद है एक incident ticket था।",
   "text_en": null,
   "start_ms": 63000,
   "end_ms": 68000,
   "speaker_label": "S3",
   "speaker": {
    "id": "person:email:arjun.rao@example.com",
    "name": "Arjun Rao"
   },
   "language": "hi-IN",
   "mentions": []
  },
  {
   "id": "utt:mtg:knadh/listmonk:listmonk-handover-campaign-manager-and-config-20261020#0007",
   "meeting_id": "mtg:knadh/listmonk:listmonk-handover-campaign-manager-and-config-20261020",
   "seq": 7,
   "text": "incident ticket है, और जो PR इसे 25 से 10 पे लाया उसकी description में भी लिखा है। लेकिन README में नहीं है, इसलिए ये call record हो रही है।",
   "text_en": null,
   "start_ms": 69000,
   "end_ms": 80000,
   "speaker_label": "S1",
   "speaker": {
    "id": "person:email:rohan.mehta@example.com",
    "name": "Rohan Mehta"
   },
   "language": "hi-IN",
   "mentions": []
  },
  {
   "id": "utt:mtg:knadh/listmonk:listmonk-handover-campaign-manager-and-config-20261020#0008",
   "meeting_id": "mtg:knadh/listmonk:listmonk-handover-campaign-manager-and-config-20261020",
   "seq": 8,
   "text": "और app.batch_size? वो 1000 क्यों है?",
   "text_en": null,
   "start_ms": 82000,
   "end_ms": 86000,
   "speaker_label": "S2",
   "speaker": {
    "id": "person:email:priya.nair@example.com",
    "name": "Priya Nair"
   },
   "language": "hi-IN",
   "mentions": [
    {
     "id": "cfg:knadh/listmonk:schema.sql::app.batch_size",
     "label": "ConfigKey",
     "name": "app.batch_size"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "utt:mtg:knadh/listmonk:listmonk-handover-campaign-manager-and-config-20261020#0009",
   "meeting_id": "mtg:knadh/listmonk:listmonk-handover-campaign-manager-and-config-20261020",
   "seq": 9,
   "text": "app.batch_size 1000 इसलिए है क्योंकि Postgres से subscribers 1000-1000 के batch में निकलते हैं, एक साथ पूरी list memory में नहीं आती। sliding window के साथ ये number well tested है, इसे बढ़ाने से DB पे load बढ़ता है, फायदा कुछ नहीं।",
   "text_en": null,
   "start_ms": 87000,
   "end_ms": 103000,
   "speaker_label": "S1",
   "speaker": {
    "id": "person:email:rohan.mehta@example.com",
    "name": "Rohan Mehta"
   },
   "language": "hi-IN",
   "mentions": [
    {
     "id": "cfg:knadh/listmonk:schema.sql::app.batch_size",
     "label": "ConfigKey",
     "name": "app.batch_size"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "utt:mtg:knadh/listmonk:listmonk-handover-campaign-manager-and-config-20261020#0010",
   "meeting_id": "mtg:knadh/listmonk:listmonk-handover-campaign-manager-and-config-20261020",
   "seq": 10,
   "text": "ठीक है। max_send_errors का क्या scene है?",
