     "name": "smtp.my0.max_msg_retries"
    },
    {
     "id": "file:knadh/listmonk:dev/config.toml",
     "label": "File",
     "name": "config.toml"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "utt:mtg:knadh/listmonk:listmonk-handover-campaign-manager-and-config-20261020#0014",
   "meeting_id": "mtg:knadh/listmonk:listmonk-handover-campaign-manager-and-config-20261020",
   "seq": 14,
   "text": "Priya, ये सब note कर लो। Rohan, अब campaign retry वाला इतिहास बताओ।",
   "text_en": null,
   "start_ms": 146000,
   "end_ms": 152000,
   "speaker_label": "S3",
   "speaker": {
    "id": "person:email:arjun.rao@example.com",
    "name": "Arjun Rao"
   },
   "language": "hi-IN",
   "mentions": []
  },
  {
   "id": "utt:mtg:knadh/listmonk:listmonk-handover-campaign-manager-and-config-20261020#0015",
   "meeting_id": "mtg:knadh/listmonk:listmonk-handover-campaign-manager-and-config-20261020",
   "seq": 15,
   "text": "हाँ, वो important है। manager.go में हमने एक बार per-message retry logic add किया था, PR merge भी हुआ। दो हफ्ते बाद duplicate sends की complaints आईं, क्योंकि SMTP timeout के बाद message actually deliver हो चुका होता था। तो हमने वो commit revert कर दिया।",
   "text_en": null,
   "start_ms": 153000,
   "end_ms": 172000,
   "speaker_label": "S1",
   "speaker": {
    "id": "person:email:rohan.mehta@example.com",
    "name": "Rohan Mehta"
   },
   "language": "hi-IN",
   "mentions": [
    {
     "id": "file:knadh/listmonk:internal/manager/manager.go",
     "label": "File",
     "name": "manager.go"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "utt:mtg:knadh/listmonk:listmonk-handover-campaign-manager-and-config-20261020#0016",
   "meeting_id": "mtg:knadh/listmonk:listmonk-handover-campaign-manager-and-config-20261020",
   "seq": 16,
   "text": "तो अभी retry बिल्कुल नहीं है?",
   "text_en": null,
   "start_ms": 173000,
   "end_ms": 178000,
   "speaker_label": "S2",
   "speaker": {
    "id": "person:email:priya.nair@example.com",
    "name": "Priya Nair"
   },
   "language": "hi-IN",
   "mentions": []
  },
  {
   "id": "utt:mtg:knadh/listmonk:listmonk-handover-campaign-manager-and-config-20261020#0017",
   "meeting_id": "mtg:knadh/listmonk:listmonk-handover-campaign-manager-and-config-20261020",
   "seq": 17,
   "text": "SMTP level पे max_msg_retries है, वो connection retry है, message retry नहीं। manager.go में application level retry दोबारा add मत करना जब तक idempotency key ना हो, ये हमारी constraint है।",
   "text_en": null,
   "start_ms": 179000,
   "end_ms": 192000,
   "speaker_label": "S1",
   "speaker": {
    "id": "person:email:rohan.mehta@example.com",
